{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2011-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1318723200, "end_date": 1319414399, "month_true_total": 93, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:45:02 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1352284", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991937454", "personaname": "Dr_Red_MD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dr_Red_MD/", "num_games_owned": 700, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 7729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6339, "last_played": 1723670713, "avatar": "1dc5a633b8f0446361247e214bba2b777836e84a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Single player is VERY linear, but also very fun. Where the game really shines is multiplayer. There are a few issues such as melee and some minor glitches, but overall, this game is fantastic! If you're a 40K fan looking for your next gaming fix, do not pass this up!", "timestamp_created": 1319399423, "timestamp_updated": 1319399423, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1352016", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991932737", "personaname": "Vic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vtedwards/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2913, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2869, "last_played": 1658488607, "avatar": "8f5adc76d7a831b61a9e85682a650d75764295d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not terribly deep, but if all you want is death to the \"enemies of man\", this game serves it up in spades.  Slashing, shooting and killing.  Lots of blood and if you are sensitive to that, don't waste your money.  Smooth graphics and good sound effects and music.  Getting to the end is a little difficult, but it is satisfying within the Warhammer 40K ethos.", "timestamp_created": 1319379446, "timestamp_updated": 1319379446, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3737384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026790397", "personaname": "Methrandir", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Wager4/", "num_games_owned": 358, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 5080, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4850, "last_played": 1640251080, "avatar": "db37a0a587ff06a5607078d5b0dd5efbbe21b706"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a good game, too bad the multiplayer severs are dead.", "timestamp_created": 1319367473, "timestamp_updated": 1404783148, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "1980951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000555757", "personaname": "Zedrin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zedrin/", "num_games_owned": 412, "num_reviews": 136, "playtime_forever": 389, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 389, "last_played": 1316329200, "avatar": "f44d5e5060d6bf7f74c45dd05276a5d39f164b4e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good but short.", "timestamp_created": 1319360568, "timestamp_updated": 1319360568, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33426", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960485586", "personaname": "BloodShed", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bloodshed/", "num_games_owned": 9005, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1617, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1525, "last_played": 1430617251, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game really captures what it's like being a space marine of the Imperium.\n\nYou are put up against a hordes of enemies and the only way to gain health is to fight them.\nThe health system works really well and keeps you in the fight and the executions you do to get health back is bloody awesome.\n\nOne of my favorite highlights of the SP campaign is the fact you get to see a warlord class battle titan.\n\nThe multiplayer is basic but fun. There are currently 2 gamemodes (1 more is coming) Annihilation (team-deathmatch) and Seize Ground (domination).\nBoth are fun to play and when you die you get the option to copy your killer's loadout and see if you can do better with that.", "timestamp_created": 1319267786, "timestamp_updated": 1385406111, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}